    "game.starship.holdTip": "Hold to fire",
    "game.starship.help": "Controls (each key fires the nozzle on that side): \u2193/S fires the tail nozzle downward to brake upward; \u2191/W fires the top nozzle upward to push the ship down; \u2190/A fires the left nozzle \u2014 jet reaction swings the nose right (clockwise); \u2192/D fires the right nozzle \u2014 nose swings left (counter-clockwise). Firing burns fuel. Tilt slightly toward the target, then brake with \u2193 to glide sideways. Land tail-first, inside the pad, at low speed \u2014 too fast, tilted or off-pad means a crash. Each recovered starship makes the next one fall faster with less fuel!",
