    "game.slingshot.holdTip": "Hold to fire",
    "game.slingshot.help": "Controls: \u2191/W tail main engine accelerates along the nose; \u2193/S nose nozzle brakes; \u2190/A and \u2192/D side nozzles turn left/right \u2014 all holdable, firing burns energy. Every planet pulls you with gravity: dive into the blue gravity well (dashed ring) to get deflected and accelerated for free \u2014 that is the slingshot (a \u226525\xB0 turn counts). Green-halo base planets refuel you automatically; reaching one switches your next destination. Meteor hits cost 30% energy and knock you back (brief invulnerability); deep atmosphere drains energy continuously, and touching a planet core bounces you with damage. Out of energy ends the route, scored by distance travelled (1px = 1km). Space starts/restarts, P pauses.",
